    "created_at": "2016-02-04T16:20:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-04T16:20:49Z",
    "body": "@ajklein @DigiTec @Constellation @jonco3 can I get some comments on this? Is this something we should add to the spec, and you are interested in implementing as you work on modules? Would really be great to get everyone's opinions here.\n",
